### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wilson@teste.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar uma meta
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Estudar 10 horas de exatas essa semana",
  "targetHours": 10,
  "weekReference": "2026-09-08"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("goalId", response.body.id);
%}

### Criar uma meta sem weekReference (deve funcionar, campo opcional)
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Meta sem semana definida",
  "targetHours": 5
}

### Listar todas as metas do usuário logado
GET http://localhost:8080/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar uma meta específica pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar a meta
PUT http://localhost:8080/goals/{{goalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Estudar 15 horas de exatas essa semana",
  "targetHours": 15,
  "weekReference": "2026-09-08"
}

### Deletar a meta
DELETE http://localhost:8080/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar meta sem token (deve dar 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Sem token",
  "targetHours": 5
}

### Criar meta com targetHours negativo (deve dar 400, validação do @Positive)
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Horas negativas",
  "targetHours": -5
}

### Criar meta com targetHours zero (deve dar 400, @Positive não aceita zero)
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Zero horas",
  "targetHours": 0
}

### Criar meta sem description (deve dar 400, validação do @NotBlank)
POST http://localhost:8080/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "targetHours": 5
}
